---
title: Installation
description: Install Design System UI Svelte items with the shadcn-svelte CLI.
order: 1
---

Install any item from **Design System UI Svelte** with the [shadcn-svelte CLI](https://www.shadcn-svelte.com/docs/cli). Replace `button` with the item name from the catalog.

Start with [styles](/docs/styles) so your project has the design system CSS foundation before adding components.

## Configure the registry

Your project must already be set up with [shadcn-svelte](https://www.shadcn-svelte.com/docs/installation). Then add this registry to `components.json` so the CLI can resolve `@design-system-ui/*` items:

```json
{
  "registries": {
    "@design-system-ui": "https://design-system-starter-svelte-docs.vercel.app/r/{name}.json"
  }
}
```

Update the URL to your deployed `homepage` from `registry/config.ts`. Do this once per project. Without it, installs fail with `Unknown registry "@design-system-ui"`.

## Install an item

### npm

```sh
npx shadcn-svelte@latest add @design-system-ui/button
```

### pnpm

```sh
pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add @design-system-ui/button
```

### yarn

```sh
yarn dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add @design-system-ui/button
```

### bun

```sh
bunx --bun shadcn-svelte@latest add @design-system-ui/button
```

You can also install via the full item URL without registering the namespace:

```sh
npx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://design-system-starter-svelte-docs.vercel.app/r/button.json
```
